        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this spacious three-bedroom duplex to the market, ideally situated within walking distance of the main street of Kill, Co. Kildare.\nBuilt c.2007, No. 81 Embassy Manor offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or those looking to upsize into a modern and well-proportioned home. Presented in excellent condition throughout, the property boasts generous internal living accommodation of c.107 sq. m.\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a bright and well-appointed kitchen/dining room to the front, a spacious living room to the rear and a convenient guest WC. Upstairs, there are three generously proportioned double bedrooms, with the main bedroom benefiting from a private ensuite, along with a main family bathroom.\nA stand out feature of No. 81 is the private rear terrace, accessed directly from the living room, providing an ideal outdoor space for relaxing or entertaining.\nThe location is truly second to none. Embassy Manor is within easy walking distance of Kill village, where residents can enjoy a fantastic selection of local amenities including schools, shops, cafés, restaurants and other everyday conveniences. The property is also ideally positioned for commuters, with easy access to the N7 and excellent transport links to Dublin City Centre via Dublin Bus. A wide range of sporting and recreational facilities are also available within the surrounding area.\nEarly viewing is highly advised to appreciate all this property has to offer. Contact RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today to arrange your viewing.\n\nFeatures\n<ul>\n <li>3 bed, 3 bath</li>\n <li>Duplex</li>\n <li>107 sq.m</li>\n <li>Gas fired central heating</li>\n <li>Sunny private ground floor terrace to the rear</li>\n <li>Ample parking</li>\n <li>Secure development</li>\n <li>Ideally located within walking distance to Kill village</li>\n <li>A wealth of amenities on your doorstep</li>\n <li>Easy access to the N7</li>\n <li>Dublin Bus offers convenient access to the City Centre</li>\n <li>Early viewing is highly advised</li>\n</ul>\n\nBER Details\nBER:  B\n\nDirections \nEircode: W91 HF76"
